1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,913
What if this Spring bean doesn't exist?

2
00:00:01,993 --> 00:00:04,580
A required audit publisher is missing.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:06,785
Spring cannot finish creating the service.

4
00:00:06,865 --> 00:00:08,260
Change the constructor parameter

5
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,680
to Optional of AuditPublisher.

6
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,379
Now absence is allowed.

7
00:00:12,459 --> 00:00:14,140
With one matching publisher,

8
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,400
Spring supplies an Optional

9
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,675
containing that managed instance.

10
00:00:17,755 --> 00:00:18,800
With no publisher,

11
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,980
Spring supplies an empty Optional.

12
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:23,774
The service skips this extra notification.

13
00:00:23,854 --> 00:00:25,920
Both optional contexts start.

14
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,520
Our tests confirm the values.

15
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,720
Ambiguity can still fail.

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:32,839
Keep critical security dependencies required.

17
00:00:34,839 --> 00:00:35,930
Thanks for watching.

